      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 58,
        "preview": "This little work aims to combine the instructive features of a book of travels with the interest of "
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 58,
        "preview": "While acknowledging my obligations to many well-known writers on Dutch history, literature, and art,"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 52,
        "preview": "Should this simple narrative serve to give my young readers a just idea of Holland and its resources"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 50,
        "preview": "Should it cause even one heart to feel a deeper trust in God’s goodness and love, or aid any in weav"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 1,
        "preview": "—M.M.D."
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 4,
        "preview": "A LETTER FROM HOLLAND"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 4,
        "preview": "Amsterdam, July 30, 1873"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 6,
        "preview": "DEAR BOYS AND GIRLS AT HOME:"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 237,
        "preview": "If you all could be here with me today, what fine times we might have walking through this beautiful"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 129,
        "preview": "Holland is as wonderful today as it was when, more than twenty years ago, Hans and Gretel skated on "
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 143,
        "preview": "Today an American boy and I, seeing some children enter an old house in the business part of Amsterd"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 136,
        "preview": "After leaving the old fire woman, who nodded a pleasant good-bye to us, and willingly put our stiver"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 59,
        "preview": "And now goodbye. Oh! I must tell you one more thing. We found today in an Amsterdam bookstore this s"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 41,
        "preview": "Good-bye again, in the touching words of our Dutch translator with whom I’m sure you’ll heartily agr"
      },
      {
        "reason": "explicit-text-bound",
        "source_id": "",
        "words": 4,
        "preview": "Yours affectionately, The Author."
      }
